# Supplemental Material

This repository contains supplemental material for the manuscript:

**“Evaluating Agentic Retrieval-Augmented Generation Architectures for Bridge Engineering and Nondestructive Evaluation”**

**Authors:** Mozhgan Momtaz, Ph.D., and Hoda Azari, Ph.D.

The supplemental material includes Figures S1–S5, which provide representative FHWA InfoTechnology chatbot examples for bridge engineering and nondestructive evaluation (NDE) applications.

These examples illustrate grounded responses, refusal behavior, retrieved visual evidence, and supporting NDE imagery and complement the quantitative evaluation presented in the manuscript.
